# armour/man/mail_sleeve_r: Mail's sleeve over the arm: the upper arm in the mail brick to the elbow
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; armour and helms to P2c's ARMOUR / HELMS). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i2) mail as lit planes with a sparse ring dot (mailfix.py), as the hauberk
use person
body man
role armour mail
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys armR
side R
z 1

view D key back origin 1 -1
|vxx
|vxw
|vxw

view D key fwd origin 1 -1
|vxx
|vxw
|vxw
|vxw
|vxw

view D key idle origin 1 -1
|vxx
|vxw
|vxw
|vxw

view D key lap origin 1 -1
|vxx
|vxw
|vxw
|vxw

view U key back origin 1 -1
|xwv
|xxv
|yxv
|yxv

view U key fwd origin 1 -1
|xwv
|xxv
|yxv
|yxv

view U key idle origin 1 -1
|xwv
|xxv
|yxv
|yxv

view U key lap origin 1 -1
|xwv
|xxv
|yxv
|yxv

view R key B origin 2 -1
|..vywxv
|.vyxwv.
|.vyxwv.
|vywwv..

view R key F origin 0 -1
|vywxv..
|.vyxwv.
|.vyxwv.
|..vyxwv

view R key N origin 0 -1
|vywxv
|vyxwv
|vyxwv
|vywwv

view R key idle origin 0 -1
|vywxv
|vyxwv
|vyxwv
|vywwv

view L key back origin -5 -6
|v

# MAN-WEAR (P2B rollout, 2026-10-22): the mail brick over the sleeve (the arm's U and F cells) on every side key the
# side clips name: the run pump (pB pM pF pK pN), runB, runF, guard and the off hand's o* keys, fitted cell for cell on the
# frozen arm drawings (far arms a value darker); before this a mail wearer's sleeves vanished in the run and drawn frames.
view R key runB origin 4 -1
|....vywxv
|..vywwv..
|.vyxwv...

view R key runF origin 0 -1
|vywxv
|vyxwv
|vyxv.

view R key guard origin -2 1
|.vywxv
|vyxv..
|vxv...
|.v....

view L key guard origin 15 1 layer armNear
|.........vywxv
|........vyxv..
|......vxv.....
|.......v......

view R key pF origin 0 -1
|vywxv.
|.vyxwv
|..vyxv

view R key pB origin 10 -1
|..........vywxv
|.......vxxwv...
|....vyxwv......

view R key pN origin 0 -1
|vywxv.
|vyxwv.
|.vyxwv

view L key pF origin 9 -1
|......vwxwv
|......vywv.
|......vxv..

view L key pB origin 3 -1
|vwxwv....
|..vywwv..
|....vyxwv

view L key pN origin -1 -1
|.

view R key pM origin 0 -1
|vywxv..
|.vyxwv.
|..vyxwv

view R key pK origin 4 -1
|....vywxv
|...vxxwv.
|..vyxwv..

view L key pM origin 6 -1
|...vwxwv
|..vywwv.
|.vyxwv..

view L key pK origin 3 -1
|vwxwv..
|.vyxwv.
|..vyxwv

# The front and back views of the keys above stay as they were (D and U frames are frozen in the P2B rollout): empty views
# say so, so the mail draws nothing there exactly as before (a later D/U pass may draw them).
view D key runF origin 0 0
|.

view U key runF origin 0 0
|.

view D key guard origin 0 0
|.

view U key guard origin 0 0
|.

# ---- (P2c SLICE-ARMOUR, ADD) the fall's recoil `fling` (the death clips): the upper arm in the brick
view D key fling origin 5 -1
|....vxx
|...vxxw
|..vyxw.

view U key fling origin 1 -1
|xwv....
|xyxv...
|.yyxv..

view R key fling origin 9 -1
|........vywxv
|......vywwv..
|....vyxwv....
